xt":"것에","x":1148,"y":1557,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"의하면","x":1229,"y":1558,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"호스트와","x":1344,"y":1556,"width":133,"height":37}]},{"text":"라우터는 네트워크 계층 주소도 가진다. 그렇다면 왜 네트워크 계층 주소와 링크 계층","words":[{"text":"라우터는","x":189,"y":1614,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"네트워크","x":336,"y":1614,"width":138,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":488,"y":1616,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"주소도","x":569,"y":1618,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"가진다.","x":686,"y":1617,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"그렇다면","x":806,"y":1617,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"왜","x":950,"y":1618,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"네트워크","x":996,"y":1618,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1141,"y":1619,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"주소와","x":1218,"y":1619,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":1334,"y":1619,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1411,"y":1618,"width":65,"height":38}]},{"text":"주소가 모두 필요한지 궁금할 것이다. 이 절에서는 링크 계층 주소의 구문과 기능 이외","words":[{"text":"주소가","x":188,"y":1674,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"모두","x":299,"y":1676,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"필요한지","x":382,"y":1675,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"궁금할","x":531,"y":1677,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"것이다.","x":648,"y":1678,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"이","x":769,"y":1678,"width":28,"height":38},{"text":"절에서는","x":814,"y":1678,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":957,"y":1679,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":1035,"y":1679,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"주소의","x":1109,"y":1680,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"구문과","x":1220,"y":1680,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"기능","x":1334,"y":1681,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"이외","x":1411,"y":1679,"width":61,"height":38}]},{"text":"에 추가로 왜 두 계층 주소가 유용한지에 대한 이유와 서로 없어서는 안 되는지에 대해","words":[{"text":"에","x":190,"y":1736,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"추가로","x":231,"y":1735,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"왜","x":346,"y":1735,"width":31,"height":38},{"text":"두","x":392,"y":1738,"width":36,"height":35},{"text":"계층","x":441,"y